KPL/PCK

Asteroid (162173) Ryugu PCK SPICE kernel File
===========================================================================

   This text PCK file contains the orientation and the size/shape data
   for Asteroid (162173) Ryugu.


Version and Date
--------------------------------------------------------

   Version 1.0 -- December 10, 2021 -- Shin-ya Murakami, ISAS/JAXA

      Swap order of definition for Ryugu's NAIF name.

   Version 0.9 -- September 28, 2020 -- Shin-ya Murakami, Keio Univ.

      Versioning is changed to M.N fomat from YYYYMMDD that represents
      a release date of each shape model. This file is based on
      hyb2_ryugu_SHAPE_v20200323.tpc, file of Version 20200323.
      Applied cosmetic changes and improved descriptions.
      Added GM value from [5].

   Version 20200323 -- March 23, 2020 -- Naru Hirata, The Univ. of Aizu

      Pole information estimated by Naoyuki Hirata (Kobe Univ.) with SPC.
      PM/W0 is adjusted to the official definition of the Hayabusa2 project.
      Values are not changed from the previous ones, but newly released
      to form the complete data set.

   Version 20190328 -- March 28, 2019 -- Naru Hirata, The Univ. of Aizu

      Pole information estimated by Naoyuki Hirata (Kobe Univ.) with SPC.
