Asteroid (162173) Ryugu name-ID mappings
--------------------------------------------------------

   The keywords below implement the Ryugu name-ID mappings.

     \begindata

        NAIF_BODY_NAME += ( '1999JU3' )
        NAIF_BODY_CODE += ( 2162173   )

        NAIF_BODY_NAME += ( 'RYUGU'   )
        NAIF_BODY_CODE += ( 2162173   )

      \begintext

End of PCK file.
